    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "zone1_content",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 82,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "User Query Input  (text area)\n\nQuick Templates:\n  6 preset research queries\n\nThread + Queue pattern\nrun_agent_thread() → background Thread\nst.session_state.queue → poll on rerun\n\nMetrics Row:\n  Tool Calls | Auto Compressions\n  Sources Found | Time\n\nActivity Feed:\n  🔧 tool  🧠 compact  💬 model  ❌ error",
      "originalText": "User Query Input  (text area)\n\nQuick Templates:\n  6 preset research queries\n\nThread + Queue pattern\nrun_agent_thread() → background Thread\nst.session_state.queue → poll on rerun\n\nMetrics Row:\n  Tool Calls | Auto Compressions\n  Sources Found | Time\n\nActivity Feed:\n  🔧 tool  🧠 compact  💬 model  ❌ error",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#94a3b8",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
